---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Atlas Electricity" description="Terms and conditions for using the Atlas Electricity website and utilizing our technical services.">
	<Header />
	<main class="pt-32 pb-20 min-h-screen bg-on-background text-on-primary relative overflow-hidden">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-primary via-on-background to-on-background"></div>
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-gutter relative z-10 w-full">
			<h1 class="font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-headline-lg text-on-primary mb-8 border-b border-surface/10 pb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
			
			<div class="space-y-6 text-surface-variant font-body-md leading-relaxed text-start opacity-90">
				<p class="text-lg text-on-primary font-semibold">Last Updated: May 31, 2026</p>
				
				<p>Welcome to the website of <strong>Atlas Electricity</strong>. By using this website or requesting our electrical services, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions:</p>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
				<p>By visiting our website or requesting an electrical maintenance or installation service, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be fully bound by these terms and all applicable laws and regulations.</p>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">2. Service Requests and Appointments</h2>
				<p>We always strive to deliver our services at the scheduled time. However, appointments may be subject to adjustment due to factors beyond our control (such as weather conditions or traffic). Our team will always contact you to confirm the final timing or in case of any changes.</p>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">3. Pricing and Payment</h2>
				<p>An initial cost estimate is provided before starting work. Once you agree to start the work, the agreed price is committed to. The total value of the service must be paid immediately upon completion of the work and confirmation of safe operation, unless another payment mechanism is agreed upon in advance.</p>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">4. Service Warranty and Liability</h2>
				<p>We guarantee the quality of our work and its compliance with applicable technical specifications. Atlas Electricity is not responsible for any damages resulting from misuse of electrical systems by the client after our team leaves, or for malfunctions resulting from voltage fluctuations from the public power grid.</p>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">5. Modifications to Terms</h2>
				<p>We reserve the right to modify these terms of service at any time. We advise you to review this page periodically to keep abreast of any new updates.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
